gpod-utils (1.4.7) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix filetype stored as source format (e.g. FLAC) instead of transcoded
    format (e.g. ALAC) after gpod-cp transcodes an unsupported audio file:
    re-scan the transcoded temp file so type, description, file_size and
    bitrate reflect the encoded output; restore source metadata and coverart

